 <h3><u>Wo mera ali mera ali mera ali hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Nabiyo ka nigehbaa'n hai jo waliyo ka wali hai<br> wo mera ali mera ali mera ali hai</p> 
  <p>Jisse mere sarkaar ki, sarkaar chali hai..(2)<br> wo mera ali...<br> Nabiyo ka nigehbaa'n hai jo...</p> 
  <p>1. Ye jab bhi the jab khilqate adam bhi nahi thi<br> hadd ye hai ki buniyade do aalam bhi nahi thi<br> jiske liye qur'an me lafz e azali hai</p> 
  <p>2. Yu hi nahi aate hai malak karne gadaayi<br> thokar me zamana hai to mutthi me khudai<br> taqdeer e ataa jiski kaneezi me pali hai</p> 
  <p>3. Jis rang ki baatein ho usi rang me dekho<br> hai marde khuda kaun kisi jang me dekho<br> toofan ke seene pa bhi jo shamma jali hai</p> 
  <p>4. Jab hogaye napaak badan rooh se mehroom<br> tab marhab o antar ko haqeeqat hui maloom<br> wo jiski nazar qehre ilahi me dhali hai</p> 
  <p>5. Nayaab wazifa hai ye fariyad nahi hai<br> juzz nade ali koi sabaq yaad nahi hai<br> jannat se hasee'n jiske dularo'n ki gali hai<br> wo mera ali mera ali mera ali haii....</p> 
